  "safety_invariants": [
    "HOLD_ENTERED, ACTUATORS_SAFE, FAULT_CLEAR while held, blocked recovery, HOLD_TIMEOUT, MISSION_ABORTED, and MISSION_COMPLETE events must carry safe/off actuator_state values.",
    "A recoverable fault may resume only when clear_event_age_s is less than or equal to max_fault_clear_age_s and any required acknowledgement is present.",
    "A mission may resume spraying only at the first spray-ledger work unit whose ledger_status is not sprayed.",
    "Any spray request for a spray_unit_id already marked sprayed must be suppressed, logged as DUPLICATE_SPRAY_SUPPRESSED, and leave pump and valves off.",
    "Telemetry sequence numbers must increase strictly, timestamps must be nondecreasing, and all outcome-required event types and fields must be present."
  ]
